# round 112 (w129): the single-experiment module on the CORRECTED YPD store. Suthers YPD carried no nucleobases, so 13 labeled genes (12 nonessential) read a lethal row; the corrected recipe adds uracil and adenine (media.py, 2026-09-22). Same cell as w102_ypdgpr / w104 with the nuc-tagged store and ratio table. Read fixed here: paired by seed against w102_ypdgpr on the released split (six seeds) and by split against w104 on the ten repeated splits (three seeds); the count of held-out genes whose rank changes comes from the prediction dumps.
